    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ALICE: Don't\nALICE: touch me.\nBETTY: Your wounds....\nALICE: Are fine.",
      "VALENTINE: Are dated from six months ago. How many radio broadcasts have we responded to? How many times have we got there too late?\nALICE: The transmissions said there was no infection up there.\nVALENTINE: These people don't need pipe dreams.",
      "VALENTINE: If we're going to go for Alaska, we're gonna’ need a lot of gasoline.\nVALENTINE: And we've sucked every small town pump dry over the last six months. We have to hit a big city. Besides...\nVALENTINE: We need to find something to haul it in.\nALICE: She's right",
      "VALENTINE: We can't go back the way we came, We'll go around.\nALICE: There's something wrong here.\nVALENTINE: The roads fucked up. Complain to the mayor.",
      "ALICE: No. This was recent. Look\nALICE: the metal hasn't had time to oxidize.\nVALENTINE: Let's just get moving. I want out of this place."
    ]
